 "description": {
  "title": "Snuggle Sorcery · Trailer · a cozy story game where you soothe curses with a lullaby",
  "text": "In the misty harbour city of Lantern Bay, curses born from small worries come out fluffy. You don't fight them: you notice them, hum your mother's lullaby, and wrap them in glowing yarn until they fall asleep.\n\nSnuggle Sorcery is a cozy story game in your browser: five chapters, an epilogue, thread fishing and a whole town to look after when the story is done. Free to play, no install, no account: https://sn0.maize.live\n\nMade in the open: three.js, Blender scripts and a lot of patience. Open source (GPL-3.0): https://github.com/doublependu/snuggle\n\nMusic: the game's own score. More web games at https://maize.live"
 }
